{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to kitesurf in 2 dimensions.  Compete in competitions, travel to new lands, race for the finish line, or just land some tricks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to kite in 2D.  Tutorial covers basic riding, loading and popping, jumping, back rolls, board offs, and kite loops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through amateur, minor league, semi pro, pro, and olympic worlds.\u00a0 Travel in traditional platformer style levels and compete in competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Comp mode includes high score challenge, best trick, racing, upside down grind mode, drone grind mode and more.\u00a0 Try to bring home the gold medal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character at the store, be sure to collect plenty of coins in travel mode to use at the store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look out for obstacles.  - Sharks, -Jellyfish, -Drones </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect powerups.  -Jump Higher, -Ride Faster, -Spin Faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indie developed.\u00a0 Plan to drop around end of this year.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3025260?t=1732926405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1732926405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732926405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732926405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to kitesurf in 2 dimensions.  Compete in competitions, travel to new lands, race for the finish line, or just land some tricks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to kite in 2D.  Tutorial covers basic riding, loading and popping, jumping, back rolls, board offs, and kite loops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through amateur, minor league, semi pro, pro, and olympic worlds.\u00a0 Travel in traditional platformer style levels and compete in competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Comp mode includes high score challenge, best trick, racing, upside down grind mode, drone grind mode and more.\u00a0 Try to bring home the gold medal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character at the store, be sure to collect plenty of coins in travel mode to use at the store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look out for obstacles.  - Sharks, -Jellyfish, -Drones </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect powerups.  -Jump Higher, -Ride Faster, -Spin Faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indie developed.\u00a0 Plan to drop around end of this year.</p>","developers":["Dumpster Buddha Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025260/header.jpg?t=1732926405","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> mac os x<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> dual core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257077607,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077607/movie480.mp4?t=1732926399","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077607/movie_max.mp4?t=1732926399"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/